 ## Background
 The specific technique of bounding a splat by a polygon in parameter space and clipping it in clip space was devised by Sebastian Lippner as part of his surface splatting implementation [S1, unofficial]. This approach addresses the limitations of previous methods that produced artifacts, particularly for large splats near the near plane [S1, unofficial]. The method is implemented in the `sebastianlipponer/surface_splatting` repository [S1, unofficial].
